WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.883
Pig, Cow, and Dog ran.

2
00:00:05.884 --> 00:00:11.741
They ran fast to the well.

3
00:00:11.742 --> 00:00:13.890
Dog looked down.

4
00:00:13.891 --> 00:00:16.225
He could hear Cat.

5
00:00:16.226 --> 00:00:18.903
But he could not see her.

6
00:00:18.904 --> 00:00:21.960
"Let me look," said Cow.

7
00:00:21.961 --> 00:00:25.611
She looked into the well.

8
00:00:25.612 --> 00:00:28.271
But it was too dark.

9
00:00:28.272 --> 00:00:31.900
She could not see Cat.

10
00:00:31.901 --> 00:00:34.851
"I know!" said Pig.

11
00:00:34.852 --> 00:00:38.178
"I will make a wish."

12
00:00:38.179 --> 00:00:50.303
He walked around the well.

13
00:00:50.304 --> 00:00:54.903
"Please, please, pretty please," said Pig.

14
00:00:54.904 --> 00:00:58.299
"Get Cat out of the well."

15
00:00:58.300 --> 00:01:00.862
But it did not work.

16
00:01:00.863 --> 00:01:08.694
Cat was still in the well.

17
00:01:08.695 --> 00:01:12.454
"Hold my legs," said Dog.

18
00:01:12.455 --> 00:01:15.150
"I will go down and get her."

19
00:01:15.151 --> 00:01:17.822
Pig held one leg.

20
00:01:17.823 --> 00:01:20.485
Cow held the other leg.

21
00:01:20.486 --> 00:01:24.015
"I'm coming, Cat!" said Dog.

22
00:01:24.016 --> 00:01:28.381
Dog went down.

23
00:01:28.382 --> 00:01:42.370
But the well was too deep.

